  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Outside the sparring arena on Fei He Mountain, spectators call both fighters only around twenty years old and still too strong, and they name Sun Yuan Hua a veteran expert who took first place in the previous third year small examination. Fang Zheng keeps a grim expression and sharp gaze and fights him evenly. Fang Zheng forces him back with jade green wind; Sun Yuan Hua laughs and tells the junior to show a trump card.",
      "chapters": [
        334
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_fei_he_mountain",
        "char_fang_zheng"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When Fang Zheng summons a huge ironbeak flying crane group, Sun Yuan Hua answers with his own hidden crane group, only a few hundred illusion lightning cranes with white feathers, blue tips on wings, tails, and claws, and blue static on their bodies. Narration calls him a sect genius who received ample nurturing, older than Fang Zheng, with crane manipulation among the best in the sect. He activates a Gu in his aperture, turns into a flash of lightning, and closes in on Fang Zheng; Fang Zheng is suppressed into defense, then they fight intensely on the ground so the junior cannot focus on the air battle, and his cranes nearly break out of the ironbeak encirclement before Fang Zheng’s diverted concentration lets the larger flock devour them. Sun Yuan Hua’s face goes pale, and Fang Zheng takes first place in the eight year middle examination by that defeat, becoming an elite disciple.",
      "chapters": [
        334
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "He is around twenty years old. He is older than Fang Zheng. When he activates a Gu in his aperture, he turns into a flash of lightning.",
      "chapters": [
        334
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Zheng later recalls spending every trump card in that match.",
      "chapters": [
        335
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "finals-match-recollection",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Elite disciples on Fang Zheng’s journey still treat surpassing Sun Yuan Hua in crane control as a near-term mark of progress.",
      "chapters": [
        336
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "crane-control-benchmark",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "When the sect announces Fang Zheng as an elder at rank five, former rivals such as Sun Yuan Hua are dumbstruck. Later, when Fang Zheng walks the sect, past rivals like Sun Yuan Hua also pay respects to him.",
      "chapters": [
        827
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "when-fang-zheng-becomes-elder",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "On Jun Shen Guang’s list of mortal Gu Masters chosen for costly Gu Immortal nurturing, Immortal Crane Sect recommends Sun Yuan Hua.",
      "chapters": [
        1970
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "gu-immortal-seed-listing",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_jun_shen_guang",
        "fac_gu_masters",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "fac_immortal_crane_sect"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In the painting world he is with Xiao Qi Xing’s group facing divine bean soldiers and is the one who asks how they should fight before the charge begins.",
      "chapters": [
        2012
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "asks-how-to-fight",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_xiao_qi_xing"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "With Xiao Qi Xing at the front, Fairy Bi Xia, Sun Yuan Hua, Sun Yao, Ying Sheng Ji, Chen Da Jiang, and the rest appear together and draw a disturbance. Narration places that group among the ten children of human path, Gu Immortal seeds Heavenly Court cultivates from Central Continent’s ten great ancient sects.",
      "chapters": [
        2065
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "ten-children-of-human-path",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
